{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23001","headline":"江西裴常侍以优礼见待又蒙赠诗輙叙鄙诚用伸感谢 · 白居易","name":"江西裴常侍以优礼见待又蒙赠诗輙叙鄙诚用伸感谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从簪笏事金貂，每借温颜放折腰。\n长觉身轻离泥滓，忽惊手重捧琼瑶。\n马因回顾虽增价，桐遇知音已半焦。\n他日秉钧如见念，壮心直气未全销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}